## Development

### Running Both Platforms
```bash
# Terminal 1 - API
cd apps/api && uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload

# Terminal 2 - Web
cd apps/web && npm run dev

# Terminal 3 - Mobile (iOS)
cd apps/mobile && flutter run -d ios

# Terminal 4 - Mobile (Android)
cd apps/mobile && flutter run -d android
```

### Testing
```bash
# Web tests
cd apps/web && npm test

# Mobile tests
cd apps/mobile && flutter test

# API tests
cd apps/api && pytest
```

## Deployment

Both platforms are designed to be deployed independently while sharing the same API backend.
See individual app READMEs for deployment instructions.

